<title>USA: Sun International enters credit agreement.</title>
<headline>Sun International enters credit agreement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun International Hotels Ltd said on Monday it entered into an agreement for a $250 million credit facility, to execute its expansion plans at Paradise Island in the Bahamas.</p>
<p>The Bahamas-based company is developing a 1,200 room deluxe hotel there, due to open in 1998.</p>
<p>The facility would be arranged by the Bank of Nova Scotia and Royal Bank of Scotland, the company said.</p>
